WEBVTT

01:00.100 --> 01:02.900
=Daughter of Fortune=

01:02.900 --> 01:05.460
(Adapted from the novel
"Phoenix Palace Dream" by Lan Jiujiu)

01:05.540 --> 01:08.460
=Episode 8=

01:10.439 --> 01:12.560
If it really wanted to eat me,

01:13.400 --> 01:14.519
would Your Majesty

01:15.079 --> 01:16.319
kill me?

01:16.900 --> 01:22.300
♪Moon sets on palace walls,
breeze hits the gates♪

01:25.599 --> 01:26.560
Yes.

01:30.540 --> 01:36.500
♪Dim lamps, concerns unheard by anyone♪

01:36.879 --> 01:38.319
If there comes a day

01:38.799 --> 01:40.480
when Your Majesty wants my life,

01:43.200 --> 01:44.840
I will offer it to you myself.

01:48.959 --> 01:50.040
Your Majesty, follow me.

01:50.190 --> 01:51.359
I have something to show you.

01:53.560 --> 01:55.359
I was reading
some ancient records last night

01:55.360 --> 01:57.420
and found the insect
the little white snake likes to eat.

01:57.439 --> 01:58.630
It's called the Crimson Butterfly.

01:58.640 --> 01:59.879
It's unique on Mount Tian.

02:00.239 --> 02:02.640
There is only one insect
in the capital similar to it.

02:03.680 --> 02:04.159
Hm.

02:07.439 --> 02:08.599
Your Majesty, don't open it.

02:08.599 --> 02:11.140
♪I walk through the palace
day and night, just for my beloved♪

02:11.500 --> 02:14.900
♪All my tenderness is for you,
I'd stay alone for you♪

02:14.900 --> 02:18.540
♪I don't ask for equality,
only that you hear me♪

02:18.540 --> 02:21.780
♪Years of longing haunt
the palace gates, too deep to hide♪

02:22.300 --> 02:23.719
Your Majesty, don't open your eyes.

02:23.960 --> 02:25.520
The fuzz on its wings is poisonous.

02:26.120 --> 02:27.000
Handan,

02:27.479 --> 02:28.919
bring a basin of fresh water.

02:29.199 --> 02:31.439
Shen Zhinian, did you do this on purpose?

02:31.440 --> 02:32.860
Your Majesty, don't open your mouth.

02:32.879 --> 02:34.610
Be careful,
or your mouth will swell up too.

02:34.680 --> 02:35.919
Young Lady, the water is here.

02:35.919 --> 02:36.319
Alright.

02:37.120 --> 02:37.800
Wait a moment.

02:38.080 --> 02:39.630
Let me wash it with fresh water for you.

02:40.840 --> 02:42.479
Your Majesty, here.

02:49.840 --> 02:50.560
Your Majesty,

02:51.400 --> 02:52.560
do you feel any better?

02:59.039 --> 03:00.439
If you had such a "good thing",

03:00.500 --> 03:01.890
how could you not share it with me?

03:02.319 --> 03:02.960
No,

03:03.080 --> 03:03.960
Your Majesty.

03:03.960 --> 03:05.120
Your Majesty, stop it.

03:08.400 --> 03:08.919
Young Lady,

03:09.080 --> 03:10.319
Lady Liu of Gentleness is here.

03:10.919 --> 03:11.639
Your Majesty,

03:12.719 --> 03:13.879
hide yourself first.

03:14.199 --> 03:15.479
You dare to tell me to hide?

03:15.719 --> 03:17.280
Is there a guest in your room, Zhinian?

03:18.080 --> 03:19.240
No, there isn't.

03:19.240 --> 03:20.360
I'll be right out.

03:24.680 --> 03:26.000
Hide in here for a moment.

03:26.110 --> 03:27.639
You dare to make me get into a cabinet?

03:28.159 --> 03:28.919
No.

03:29.000 --> 03:30.800
I'm afraid if she
knows Your Majesty is here,

03:30.800 --> 03:31.840
she will refuse to leave.

03:31.960 --> 03:33.759
So you think I am
someone who can't be seen?

03:33.759 --> 03:34.960
I didn't mean it like that.

03:35.080 --> 03:36.780
Let me just
send her away first, alright?

03:37.319 --> 03:38.240
Hide for a moment.

03:38.439 --> 03:39.759
You'd better think that way.

03:47.000 --> 03:49.390
Ruyan, why do you have
time to visit my Tinglan Palace today?

03:49.759 --> 03:51.439
I've come to congratulate you.

03:52.080 --> 03:53.400
Ruyan, please come in.

03:54.400 --> 03:55.360
Please have a seat.

03:56.400 --> 03:58.039
I wonder what there is to congratulate?

03:58.210 --> 04:00.520
Your elder sister has been
titled County Princess Ning'an.

04:00.600 --> 04:02.639
She's become the favorite
of the Dowager Consort.

04:02.919 --> 04:04.520
Is that not a joyous event?

04:07.439 --> 04:08.960
Although I am from the Liu family,

04:09.000 --> 04:10.520
you saw how Lady Liu
of Bright Deportment

04:10.520 --> 04:11.319
treated me.

04:12.599 --> 04:15.599
Please help me say a few kind words
before the Dowager Consort.

04:16.360 --> 04:17.560
You overestimated me.

04:18.040 --> 04:19.360
In front of the Dowager Consort,

04:19.380 --> 04:20.520
what influence could I have?

04:20.639 --> 04:22.160
You have County Princess Ning'an.

04:28.879 --> 04:29.759
Zhinian,

04:29.959 --> 04:31.040
please just help me.

04:37.730 --> 04:38.680
Is someone in the room?

04:38.879 --> 04:39.600
No.

04:39.959 --> 04:41.240
It might be the cat I'm raising.

04:42.000 --> 04:43.519
We shouldn't let it break your things.

04:44.000 --> 04:45.100
It's better to be careful.

04:45.120 --> 04:45.720
Ruyan.

04:53.700 --> 04:54.959
What are you looking for, Ruyan?

05:01.240 --> 05:03.120
Your clothes are too plain.

05:03.120 --> 05:04.920
I'll send a few outfits over another day.

05:05.319 --> 05:07.079
You should dress up properly.

05:07.079 --> 05:09.240
Don't embarrass County Princess Ning'an.

05:09.750 --> 05:11.319
Ruyan, I'm afraid you've misunderstood.

05:11.600 --> 05:12.720
My elder sister

05:12.920 --> 05:14.160
has always looked down on me.

05:14.759 --> 05:16.120
Regarding your request,

05:16.519 --> 05:18.000
I'm afraid I cannot help.

05:19.079 --> 05:19.959
Never mind.

05:20.319 --> 05:22.639
By the way, the Empress Dowager's
birthday is approaching.

05:23.040 --> 05:24.360
I want to choreograph a dance

05:24.460 --> 05:25.480
and invite you to join me.

05:27.240 --> 05:28.480
If we team up,

05:28.959 --> 05:30.399
we will shine.

05:31.639 --> 05:33.279
Ruyan, I'm afraid
you'll be disappointed.

05:33.560 --> 05:35.560
I am not good at dancing.

05:39.240 --> 05:41.240
I really wish to befriend you, Zhinian.

05:41.959 --> 05:43.319
If you look down on me,

05:43.519 --> 05:44.720
I won't bother you anymore.

05:53.839 --> 05:56.199
(So he escaped through the window.)

05:58.200 --> 06:00.240
Shen Zhinian must be
trying to harm Your Majesty.

06:00.240 --> 06:01.160
She is not.

06:03.800 --> 06:04.680
She didn't.

06:04.800 --> 06:06.399
Your Majesty's eyes are in this state,

06:06.480 --> 06:07.839
yet you still speak for her.

06:08.279 --> 06:09.519
Could it be

06:09.720 --> 06:11.399
that you have fallen for her?

06:12.920 --> 06:13.839
How dare you.

06:14.560 --> 06:15.639
I have not fallen for her.

06:16.199 --> 06:17.300
My apologies, Your Majesty.

06:18.680 --> 06:19.639
But then again,

06:20.680 --> 06:21.920
her catching insects

06:22.360 --> 06:23.839
was indeed to please me.

06:24.560 --> 06:25.240
Yes,

06:25.519 --> 06:27.040
she did it to please Your Majesty.

06:27.680 --> 06:30.360
Then, will Your Majesty still
title her Lady of Beauty?

06:30.639 --> 06:32.360
I am in no rush, so why are you?

06:32.800 --> 06:33.319
Get out.

06:41.600 --> 06:43.079
If there comes a day

06:43.519 --> 06:45.480
when Your Majesty wants my life,

06:48.040 --> 06:49.480
I will offer it to you myself.

06:50.680 --> 06:52.160
Little liar.

07:00.160 --> 07:02.439
If it wanted to eat me,

07:03.120 --> 07:04.480
would Your Majesty

07:04.879 --> 07:06.240
kill me?

07:08.639 --> 07:09.600
I would.

07:10.690 --> 07:12.319
(I have been in the palace for so long,)

07:12.600 --> 07:15.000
(yet I still haven't gained
Nangong Xuanyu's trust.)

07:15.639 --> 07:18.360
(Shen Nanqiao entered
the palace just like in her past life.)

07:19.040 --> 07:21.639
(Lu Jianglin has also gained
the Dowager Consort's favor.)

07:21.920 --> 07:23.399
(Is it possible that everything)

07:23.680 --> 07:25.360
(from my past life will happen again?)

07:29.160 --> 07:31.480
(What should I do?)

07:35.560 --> 07:39.199
- Longevity to the Dowager Consort.
- Longevity to the Dowager Consort.

07:39.199 --> 07:40.480
- May your virtue shine forever.
- May your virtue shine forever.

07:50.600 --> 07:52.360
Senior Attendant, you're finally back.

07:53.839 --> 07:54.839
What did she call you?

07:56.800 --> 07:57.680
My surname is Chang.

07:57.680 --> 07:59.199
They call me Eunuch Chang.

08:08.639 --> 08:10.920
Jianglin and Nanqiao brought back

08:10.920 --> 08:12.990
a thousand-year-old
immortal tree from Nanhua Temple

08:13.319 --> 08:14.920
to celebrate my birthday.

08:23.199 --> 08:24.800
(Weeping flowering peach blossoms.)

08:25.519 --> 08:27.000
(There is an immortal tree in Nanhua,)

08:27.020 --> 08:28.879
(its weeping branches
bearing peach blossoms.)

08:29.079 --> 08:31.040
(But once it leaves Mount Nanhua,)

08:31.040 --> 08:32.360
(it can hardly survive.)

08:32.360 --> 08:34.919
This tree is called
the Weeping Peach Tree.

08:34.919 --> 08:36.720
It is a thousand years old.

08:37.279 --> 08:39.720
Not only is it vibrant and beautiful,

08:39.919 --> 08:42.000
but its fruit can also
strengthen the body

08:42.000 --> 08:43.120
and prolong one's life.

08:43.399 --> 08:45.399
Transplanting this tree was difficult.

08:45.399 --> 08:47.960
Fortunately,
Young Master Lu is widely learned,

08:48.279 --> 08:50.679
and Nanqiao is an expert in flora.

08:51.080 --> 08:53.480
Only then could it be
brought to the capital safely.

08:53.679 --> 08:55.840
Lu Jianglin, you've earned
the Dowager Consort's favor.

08:56.320 --> 08:57.360
That was not an easy task.

08:59.679 --> 09:00.879
I have little talent,

09:01.300 --> 09:03.720
but I am willing to serve
Your Majesty like a dog or a horse.

09:03.960 --> 09:05.320
I don't lack dogs or horses.

09:05.840 --> 09:07.799
Besides, if I were to ride you
like a horse,

09:08.080 --> 09:09.970
I'm afraid the Dowager Consort
wouldn't be pleased.

09:21.399 --> 09:22.120
Your Majesty,

09:22.279 --> 09:23.200
Dowager Consort,

09:23.559 --> 09:25.919
I would like to perform
a peach blossom dance.

09:26.080 --> 09:27.320
Ruyan, you're a gifted dancer.

09:27.399 --> 09:29.000
Go ahead and perform a piece.

09:29.440 --> 09:30.759
What does Your Majesty think?

09:31.200 --> 09:31.720
Alright.

09:33.090 --> 09:34.840
Senior Attendant Rou
is also a good dancer.

09:35.279 --> 09:37.759
I would like to invite her

09:38.559 --> 09:39.639
to dance with me.

09:46.000 --> 09:47.039
I am clumsy.

09:47.100 --> 09:48.990
I fear I might ruin your mood,
Dowager Consort.

09:53.000 --> 09:54.519
Zhinian once suffered a leg injury.

09:54.679 --> 09:55.759
She really cannot dance.

09:56.120 --> 09:57.200
Zhinian?

09:57.639 --> 09:58.960
Young Master Lu, you call her

09:58.960 --> 10:00.519
a bit too intimately, don't you?

10:01.200 --> 10:02.879
Young Master Lu came from a poor family.

10:03.000 --> 10:04.830
He once studied
at the Shen family's academy.

10:04.840 --> 10:06.399
He was my father's personal student.

10:06.559 --> 10:08.879
Nanqiao, Young Master Lu, and I

10:09.039 --> 10:10.520
have known each other since childhood.

10:11.200 --> 10:12.879
Lu watched her grow up.

10:14.080 --> 10:15.759
He is like an older brother to her.

10:16.159 --> 10:17.320
In that case,

10:17.559 --> 10:19.080
there is no need to be formal.

10:19.440 --> 10:20.840
Join Ruyan

10:20.960 --> 10:22.080
and dance a piece together.

10:27.960 --> 10:28.960
Yes.

10:53.840 --> 10:56.240
(There is the scent
of Love Potion on her silk.)

11:04.120 --> 11:06.039
(So, she plans to frame Lu Jianglin.)

11:06.220 --> 11:07.559
(Once Lu Jianglin loses control)

11:07.559 --> 11:08.639
(and comes after me...)

11:15.919 --> 11:16.919
The second dance,

11:17.480 --> 11:18.960
The Drunken Concubine.

11:33.639 --> 11:35.440
(This is the drugged cup.)

11:38.200 --> 11:38.799
What is it?

11:39.240 --> 11:40.679
Why did she fall?

11:42.960 --> 11:44.159
What happened?

11:46.480 --> 11:48.559
What a "Mouse Playing
Under the Moon" dance.

11:48.840 --> 11:50.120
I am impressed.

11:59.440 --> 12:00.440
So hot...

12:01.120 --> 12:02.159
It's so hot.

12:02.320 --> 12:03.039
Lady Liu,

12:03.120 --> 12:04.000
what are you doing?

12:06.519 --> 12:07.240
You slut.

12:07.759 --> 12:08.799
You slut.

12:09.759 --> 12:10.919
How disrespectful.

12:11.279 --> 12:12.600
Drag her out now.

12:15.720 --> 12:18.240
How can such improper behavior
be acceptable before the throne?

12:20.480 --> 12:21.399
The peach tree...

12:21.720 --> 12:22.559
How could this be?

12:25.320 --> 12:26.240
Look, what's going on?

12:26.240 --> 12:27.879
This is an ill omen.

12:29.720 --> 12:30.759
On the peach tree...

12:30.879 --> 12:31.679
Look.

12:35.240 --> 12:36.240
Senior Attendant Rou,

12:36.399 --> 12:37.639
just what have you done?

12:37.960 --> 12:39.320
This is the immortal tree

12:39.360 --> 12:40.990
I prepared for
the Dowager Consort's birthday.

12:41.240 --> 12:41.799
Presumptuous!

12:42.159 --> 12:43.600
How dare you curse me?

12:43.759 --> 12:44.519
Guards,

12:45.240 --> 12:47.039
send Shen Zhinian to the Cold Palace.

12:57.880 --> 13:03.000
♪Broken dreams,
listening to the light rain♪

13:04.720 --> 13:09.960
♪Bitter cold, bringing mist to the eyes♪

13:11.600 --> 13:13.960
♪If we don't meet♪

13:14.160 --> 13:17.400
♪Flowers bloom and fall in shame♪

13:17.600 --> 13:24.120
♪If we meet again,
the peaches will be warm♪

13:24.480 --> 13:30.920
♪Spring breeze passes,
dancing through the years♪

13:31.280 --> 13:37.600
♪Brewing longing,
remembering past lives♪

13:38.120 --> 13:44.800
♪Hard to meet, and just as hard to part♪

13:44.800 --> 13:51.680
♪Who planted the beans
that grew into lotuses?♪

13:51.920 --> 13:57.800
♪Spring breeze passes,
composing the fleeting years♪

13:58.720 --> 14:05.320
♪Clouds on Mount Wu,
no sails on the sea♪

14:05.480 --> 14:12.160
♪Wanting to fold
my heart into a paper kite♪

14:12.440 --> 14:18.880
♪But the ties are too tangled to sever♪
